CHAPTER.VERS:
Speak to the sons of Israel, saying, You

          {+}
         will eat no fat, of ox, or sheep, or goat.

And the fat of that which dies of itself, and the fat of that which is torn of beasts, may be used for any other service; but you

          {+}
         will in no way eat of it.

And you

          {+}
         will eat no manner of blood, whether it is of bird or of beast, in any of your

          {+}
         dwellings.

And the right thigh you

          {+}
         will give to the priest for a heave-offering out of the sacrifices of your

          {+}
         peace-offerings.
